Z||000006||Oreif||09-14-2000||10:58 AM||||The Buick was the "hard luck" entry. He had such hard luck with his Fiero he had to drive his Mom's car. (Just kidding, It was a worker in the buildings' car) Actually the "hard luck" winner was Jack. If you look at Haze's pics it's the red one that looks raised up on the driver side. He got a flat getting to the show. The cause of the flat? A Ford key! I think one of Archie's pics shows the key in the tire. I tell you Ford will do anything to keep from looking like the bad guy in this tire scandal.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
